# Chevill, Bane of Monsters against Chevill (CR 603.4, 603.10a; the rulings: any bounty counter counts, whoever put it there, and
# a Chevill leaving at the same time as a bounty permanent still sees it die). Bot1's Chevill (turn 1), Bot2's (turn 2).
# Turn 3: Bot1's upkeep puts a counter on Bot2's Chevill (an opponent's, none yet). Turn 4: Bot2's upkeep puts one on Bot1's
# Chevill - Bot2's own Chevill carrying a counter does not stop it, only Bot1's side would. Turn 5: Bot1's opponents control
# a counter, so none is added (Bot2's Chevill stays at 1). Bot1's Chevill attacks, Bot2's blocks, and both die at once to
# deathtouch: each player's Chevill sees the other's counter-bearing Chevill die as they leave together, so both gain 3 and
# draw a card.

